## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
* No backend unit tests are required for Phase 4.
* We will perform standard JS console error validations on the prototype files to verify zero runtime execution errors.

### Manual Verification
1. Open [index.html](file:///e:/projects/leitner-learning-platform/docs/ui/prototype/index.html) in the local web browser.
2. Verify visual appearance in **Wireframe Mode** vs. **High-Fidelity Mode**.
3. Go through the full user journey:
   - Authenticate with OTP (digits entry).
   - Verify Terms and Rules Screen checks.
   - Complete Profile form, checking read-only mobile field.
   - Complete the Guided Onboarding walkthrough step-by-step.
   - Check Banner rotation (every 4 seconds) on the dashboard.
   - Test Course list sort orders and color-coded borders.
   - Toggle Offline Mode, check offline banner and filtered list.
   - Go to Flashcard reviews, click card to flip (3D transition).
   - Test "Know" and "Don't Know" review logic updating Box progress.
   - Click card number to trigger Jump-To dialog, confirming Box 2-5 warning alert.
   - Add a custom card under "Create Card".
   - Review Statistics charts and colors.
   - Click Logout in Settings, check verification dialog.
4. Record a web interaction video using the browser subagent, verifying all components function correctly without errors, and save it in the artifacts folder.
